  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Finely chop celery and brown onion.\n• Grate carrot.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Slice fresh lasagne sheet in half widthways.\n• Drain and rinse lentils. Little cooks: Under adult supervision, older kids can help grate the zest.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd956a0d670a6c9690a67-a48481d2.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook celery, onion and carrot, stirring, until softened, 7-8 minutes.\n• Add garlic & herb seasoning and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium, then add diced tomatoes with onion & garlic, vegetable stock pot, lentils, the butter, brown sugar and water, and cook until thickened, 4-6 minutes. Season with a pinch of salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd956a0d670a6c9690a67-cb625eff.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a small saucepan over medium heat. Heat light cooking cream, until starting to steam, 2-4 minutes.\n• Add Parmesan cheese and whisk until combined and smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd956a0d670a6c9690a67-737008cf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spoon half of the lentil filling into a medium baking dish. Top with a layer of lasagne sheets (lay two sheets alongside each other for 4 people).\n• Repeat with the remaining lentil filling and lasagne sheets. Top with bechamel sauce.\n• Bake lasagne, until golden, 20-25 minutes. Little cooks: Help assemble the lasagne!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd956a0d670a6c9690a67-7750a798.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the lasagne has 5 minutes remaining, combine mixed salad leaves, a drizzle of balsamic vinegar and olive oil in a medium bowl. Season to taste. Little cooks: Take the lead by tossing the salad.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd956a0d670a6c9690a67-0ea36bbf.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Divide lentil and hidden veggie lasagne between plates. Serve with mixed leaf salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-674cd956a0d670a6c9690a67-93044599.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
